  id: liv.rubbings
  displayName: Rubbings
  description: Liv wants the marks on the carved stones in the deep woods. Take a Blank Parchment, read a stone, and bring the rubbing home to learn it.
  chain: The Old Marks
  journalNotes: 'Carved stones stand in rings of standing stones, where Liv was found, and where the stones walk. Each can be read once a raid: it sharpens your Runecraft. With a Blank Parchment in your bag you take a rubbing too: an inscription of one of the stones'' enchantments you don''t know yet. Get it home and read it there.


    Blank Parchment: 2 Nettle Fiber and 1 Charcoal, by hand.'
